# Build context of the Dockerfile: only what the image build copies. The
# repo itself is mounted read-only at run time (see the Makefile).
*
!tests/fetch_mmt_dpi_package.sh
# The release and agent targets (T5.3, #161): the wheel and the lock of its
# dependencies.
!dist/mmt_plugin-*.whl
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# The agent target (#161): the skills, without byte code.
!skills/
skills/**/__pycache__
skills/**/*.pyc
